WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.095 --> 00:00:01.761
- This pig probably had a family--

00:00:01.761 --> 00:00:04.057
- Shh.
- With feelings.

00:00:04.057 --> 00:00:04.952
- [Woman with Purple Hair] Stop.

00:00:04.952 --> 00:00:08.737
(upbeat music)

00:00:17.568 --> 00:00:19.580
- Here's the thing, I come
from a Chinese background.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:23.522
We literally try to eat
every bit of the animal

00:00:23.522 --> 00:00:24.701
so I'm pretty used to this.

00:00:24.701 --> 00:00:28.114
- I wonder how many boogers
are in this burrito.

00:00:28.114 --> 00:00:30.064
- It looks crazy.

00:00:30.064 --> 00:00:32.056
- It looks like regular meat.

00:00:32.056 --> 00:00:33.519
- What kind of meat you be eatin'?

00:00:33.519 --> 00:00:35.143
- Mm.

00:00:35.143 --> 00:00:36.755
It tastes like fat.

00:00:38.110 --> 00:00:39.736
- Although you can see like the hairs.

00:00:39.736 --> 00:00:41.016
- It's a little hairy.

00:00:41.016 --> 00:00:42.926
- That's like when I haven't
shaved for two weeks.

00:00:42.926 --> 00:00:44.591
- It's a lot softer than I expected.

00:00:44.591 --> 00:00:45.547
- It's very tender.

00:00:45.547 --> 00:00:47.862
- I don't know if it's
like the oil from the pig

00:00:47.862 --> 00:00:49.874
or it's the oil like they added on later,

00:00:49.874 --> 00:00:51.174
but it's very greasy.

00:00:51.174 --> 00:00:52.392
- It's just super gelatinous.

00:00:52.392 --> 00:00:54.303
Like it just feels like
you're biting into fat.

00:00:54.303 --> 00:00:55.929
- It's so squishy.

00:00:55.929 --> 00:00:58.123
- The texture and the sliminess
makes me think of snot.

00:00:58.123 --> 00:00:59.017
- This is snot.

00:00:59.017 --> 00:01:01.171
Y'all, this isn't oil, oil
doesn't stretch like that.

00:01:01.171 --> 00:01:04.075
- Something about it, it's
just messin' with my mind.

00:01:04.075 --> 00:01:05.091
- I just can't get over the fact that

00:01:05.091 --> 00:01:06.575
it came from a little piggy.

00:01:06.575 --> 00:01:10.374
- You're eating Fred and George and Porky.

00:01:10.374 --> 00:01:11.512
- I think it's important to eat

00:01:11.512 --> 00:01:12.954
other parts of the animal.

00:01:12.954 --> 00:01:14.214
Otherwise it just goes to waste.

00:01:14.214 --> 00:01:17.830
- It's weird that people
have like certain parts

00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:19.723
of animals that they feel are more

00:01:19.723 --> 00:01:21.385
like "justifiable" to eat.

00:01:21.385 --> 00:01:23.599
- There's a lot more to the
animal that goes to waste.

00:01:23.599 --> 00:01:25.306
- I love the idea of
using the entire animal.

00:01:25.306 --> 00:01:26.151
- At least that way you're kind of

00:01:26.151 --> 00:01:27.370
respecting the whole life.

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:28.406
- If you're gonna kill an animal,

00:01:28.406 --> 00:01:30.403
you might as well utilize all of it.

00:01:32.368 --> 00:01:35.069
- Oh, I was gonna eat that.

00:01:35.069 --> 00:01:36.208
What is it?

00:01:36.208 --> 00:01:37.052
Should we open it up?

00:01:37.052 --> 00:01:39.096
- Bum, bum, bum, bum!

00:01:39.096 --> 00:01:41.676
(gasping and laughing)

00:01:41.676 --> 00:01:44.784
(yelling)
- That's a pig nose!

00:01:44.784 --> 00:01:47.812
- I'm gonna cry.
(laughing)

00:01:47.812 --> 00:01:50.134
- Oh yeah.

00:01:57.341 --> 00:01:59.215
Oh boy.

